  "zovšeobecnených polárnych súradníc $x={@0}r\\cos\\varphi$, $y={@1}r\\sin\\varphi$": "일반화된 극좌표 $x={@0}r\\cos\\varphi$, $y={@1}r\\sin\\varphi$",
  "{@0} Do intervalu $(0^\\circ;90^\\circ)$ patrí {@1} z nich, odpoveď je <strong>{@2}</strong>.": "{@0} 그중 구간 $(0^\\circ;90^\\circ)$에 속하는 것은 {@1}개이므로 답은 <strong>{@2}</strong>예요.",
  "{@0} Najmenší kladný z nich je ${@1}^\\circ$.": "{@0} 그중 가장 작은 양수는 ${@1}^\\circ$예요.",
  "{@0}. Determinant sústavy je ${@1}\\cdot{@2}-{@3}^2={@4}\\neq 0$, sústava má jediné riešenie $x={@5}$, $y={@6}$.": "{@0}. 연립방정식의 행렬식은 ${@1}\\cdot{@2}-{@3}^2={@4}\\neq 0$이므로 해는 $x={@5}$, $y={@6}$ 하나뿐이에요.",
  "{@0}. Jednotkový vektor $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$. $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$.": "{@0}. 단위벡터 $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$. $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$.",
  "{@0}. Teda $\\nabla f({@1},{@2})=({@3};\\,{@4})$.": "{@0}. 따라서 $\\nabla f({@1},{@2})=({@3};\\,{@4})$예요.",
  "Úroveň c": "높이 c",
